cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: >-
  Protests over Mykhailo Fedorov leaving the Defence Ministry:
  a dataset of Ukrainian media publications, 16 July – 6 August 2026
abstract: >-
  A dataset of publications by Ukrainian national, regional and local media on the
  «cardboard protests» (картонкові протести) that followed Mykhailo Fedorov's
  departure from the post of Minister of Defence of Ukraine. 819 publications across
  127 domains, 33 locations and 22 consecutive days. The unit of observation is
  publication × city; each record carries a banded crowd-size estimate, the verbatim
  Ukrainian quote the figure comes from, its attribution and provenance, and a link
  to the original publication. Location-level records additionally carry the peak
  over the wave and how long the protest is documented as lasting.
